  message: "Partially addressed in PR #2140. Added utility dampening for assert/panic/exit builtins and UI primitive components (Button, Icon, etc.). Remaining: edge-type weighting (renders_component vs calls) and PageRank/betweenness centrality are larger architectural changes that would require a separate design effort."  # 8512
